From 27e2cbf9e887b49c29bbfd2260944b1f8081670e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christophe Kerello <christophe.kerello@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 15:51:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 538/572] fix(stm32mp2-fdts): move EV1 board to latest OMM/OSPI
 bindings

Update the EV1 board OSPI child node addressing to the latest upstream
bindings, using spi@0 instead of the legacy spi@40430000.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git c74da48e6bf82162989e0fadb72e14a833abe48c fix(stm32mp2-fdts): move EV1 board to latest OMM/OSPI bindings]
Change-Id: I2898bb4d18ca8053fdd1c3d65e9df025844978d5
Signed-off-by: Christophe Kerello <christophe.kerello@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/583564
Reviewed-by: Christophe KERELLO <christophe.kerello@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Christophe KERELLO <christophe.kerello@st.com>
Tested-by: Christophe KERELLO <christophe.kerello@st.com>
---
 fdts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/fdts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts b/fdts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts
index 3a311f7336..8af808b7b5 100644
--- a/fdts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts
+++ b/fdts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts
@@ -176,7 +176,7 @@
 		     &ospi_port1_cs0_pins_a>;
 	status = "okay";
 
-	spi@40430000 {
+	spi@0 {
 		#address-cells = <1>;
 		#size-cells = <0>;
 		status = "okay";
-- 
2.53.0

